plittings, and how do their lifetimes depend on ultraviolet physics when that protection is explicitly broken?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0060"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:2643848d989168e8ca87282d0a59ecfc2a4786431c2a9fed7a4a3c7951703e75","title":"Does the sign of a string-derived ultraviolet vacuum energy constrain the sign of the cosmological vacuum energy after integrating all lower-energy fluctuations? The question requires specified matching data, particle thresholds and a distinction between a running coupling and the full effective potential.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0063"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:2648abcaaf2f83242d5f9a29dbe00c7297d17033dac7559dea8c879d0fa6cffb","title":"Do general LVS correction sensitivities and the control obstruction in one explicit model prevent controlled dS vacua throughout the LVS class?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0071"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:261a92e1df02c7cc99e264738b2c7fd2c6b1704405550c42045a50609b0f0156","title":"Can Fibre Inflation produce primordial black holes consistently with CMB constraints, and can the associated scalar-induced gravitational waves remain detectable when the PBH dark-matter abundance is negligible?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0072"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:269ecc88d5615167652092cbedffc6581d7d69a89251257f1b610c6e42036b47","title":"Can quantum membrane nucleation dynamically relax an arbitrary matter-sector vacuum energy toward Λ→0⁺, suppress further discharge near Minkowski space, and permit ordinary cosmology without anthropic selection?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0073"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:26353d6150208e09edb2933b34f7b59aa63d3b07f8161ac0d40ca